# Build-context filter for the studio image (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# The context is the apps/ monorepo root; scope it down to just the nmem-* library sources
# this image installs so the daemon isn't shipped every sibling repo, venv, and .git.
*
!nmem
!nmem-sym
!nmem-act
!nmem-exchange
!nmem-sym-sensor

# prune heavy / irrelevant bits from the included libraries (last-match-wins)
**/.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/node_modules
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
nmem/docs
nmem/tests
nmem-sym/tests
nmem-act/tests
nmem-exchange/tests
nmem-sym-sensor/tests
# nmem-sym-sensor's working tree carries multi-GB local artifacts (training videos, audio, model
# checkpoints) that pip does NOT need — the appliance installs only the package source. Excluding them
# keeps the studio image ~2GB (else the COPY balloons it to ~20GB) and shrinks the build context.
nmem-sym-sensor/videos
nmem-sym-sensor/training_data
nmem-sym-sensor/checkpoints*
nmem-sym-sensor/_design
nmem-sym-sensor/**/*.pth
nmem-sym-sensor/**/*.onnx
nmem-sym-sensor/**/*.mp4
nmem-sym-sensor/**/*.wav
